  "steps": [
   "Grate all the carrot with a box grater. Wash and slice the strawberries. Chop the walnuts roughly with a knife.",
   "Set out 8 jars or containers. In each one, stir together the oats, whey, chia, cinnamon and yogurt with a splash of water until smooth and thick.",
   "Add the grated carrot to each jar and stir in.",
   "Top each jar with the sliced strawberries, the frozen blueberries and the chopped walnuts. Close the lids.",
   "Keep the jars in the fridge overnight, or up to 4 days. The blueberries thaw and color the oats as they sit.",
